            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.524,
            0.881,
            0.557
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Q1. Can the children rearrange themselves so that the children standing at the ends say ‘2’?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.559,
            0.839,
            0.578
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans. No; There will be no one standing on the other side of the child standing at the end."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.587,
            0.735,
            0.622
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Q2. Can we arrange the children in a line so that all would say only 0s?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Ans. Yes; All the children in the line should be of same height."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.631,
            0.744,
            0.668
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Q3. Can two children standing next to each other say the same number?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Ans. Yes; Refer picture on page 55."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.676,
            0.882,
            0.712
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Q4. There are 5 children in a group, all of different heights. Can they stand such that four of them say ‘1’ and the last one says ‘0’? Why or why not?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.721,
            0.677,
            0.74
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans. Yes, they can, if they are standing in ascending order of height."
            }
          ]
        },
